    "page_text_en": "The longer the mouse played, the harder Frog cried.\n\"Frog, why are you crying?\" the mouse asked.\n\"Because... because your playing is so beautiful!\" Frog cried.\nIn such beautiful music, he could no longer control his emotions.",
